  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEF 24 25 - Equalities Programming in El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to gather statistical information on the perception of discrimination within various sectors of the Salvadoran population. Its goal is to document and analyse Salvadorans&#x2019; opinions regarding discrimination against women, people with disabilities, LGBT+ communities, and other ethnicities. The gathered information could serve as a guide for creating and implementing polices and projects aimed at promoting the eradication of different forms of discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
